WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.194
Let's make one sound fit the track. On track one, open Sound and play pad five to select its clap.

2
00:00:06.258 --> 00:00:11.187
Press the data dial to open that pad's sample. Now you can see the waveform you're working on.

3
00:00:11.187 --> 00:00:17.451
Turn Q one to adjust the start. Take off a little space, but keep the attack that gives the sound its punch.

4
00:00:17.451 --> 00:00:22.194
Q three changes the tuning. Try a little lower, then play pad five to hear the edit.

5
00:00:22.194 --> 00:00:27.216
Press the dial to keep the edit. You're changing this track's sound, and Undo can restore it.

6
00:00:27.216 --> 00:00:33.527
Shift and Main takes you to Play. Try pad five again. Small sample edits can make a kit feel like your own.
